    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge the colored blocks to form larger colored combinations as the speed gradually increases, challenging you to maximize your score and set a new high score. Stay strategic and quick to adapt as the pace intensifies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Match four vibrant blocks in cozy clusters. Easy to learn, satisfying to master, with a quiet challenge that grows as you play</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every speed increase, the blocks accelerate, forge vast unions of color before time outmaneuvers your strategy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start by blending small blocks, but as momentum surges, craft sprawling mergers to outpace the rising challenge and reign supreme</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple core mechanic with a colorful/soft palette which has a relaxing tone with underlying challenge</p>",
